# Changelog

All notable changes to the `.claude/` documentation structure will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [2.0.0] - 2025-11-19

### Added - Major AI-Blueprint Restructuring

#### New Documentation Structure

- **`METADATA-SCHEMA.md`** - Standard frontmatter template for all documentation files
- **`INDEX.md`** - Master navigation guide for all `.claude/` content
- **`CHANGELOG.md`** - This file, tracking documentation evolution

#### New Index Files

- `rules/INDEX.md` - Navigation for all coding standards and patterns
- `templates/INDEX.md` - Catalog of code generation templates
- `snippets/INDEX.md` - Browser for code fragments and configs

#### New Core Documentation

- `core/getting-started.mdx` - Quick onboarding guide for new developers

#### New Astro Rules (7 files)

- `rules/astro/content/collections.mdx` - Content Collections patterns
- `rules/astro/content/frontmatter.mdx` - Frontmatter schemas
- `rules/astro/content/images.mdx` - Image optimization patterns
- `rules/astro/layouts/layout-hierarchy.mdx` - Layout structure guide
- `rules/astro/layouts/slots-patterns.mdx` - Slot usage patterns
