### Changed

#### Metadata Enhancements

- Added standardized frontmatter to all 42+ existing files
- Frontmatter includes: title, description, category, priority, tokenEstimate, tags, relatedFiles, version, useWhen
- All files now follow METADATA-SCHEMA.md standards

#### CLAUDE.md Optimization

- **Reduced from 333 lines to ~150 lines** (55% reduction)
- Removed duplicated content from `core/` files
- Now focuses on: Commands, Navigation, Core Standards
- Delegates details to specialized files
- Token estimate reduced from ~450 to ~200 tokens

#### Command Consolidation

- **Merged** `generate-commit-message.md` into `commit-push-smart.md`
- Enhanced `commit-push-smart.md` with:
  - Detailed message mode (title + description up to 300 chars)
  - Export functionality
  - Interactive line-by-line editing
  - Better validation and character counting
- **Reduced total commands from 6 to 5** (meets documentation standard)

#### Configuration Reorganization

- **Reorganized** `snippets/generic/configs/` → `snippets/configs/`
- New structure with tool-specific subdirectories:
  - `snippets/configs/astro/` - Astro configuration
  - `snippets/configs/eslint/` - ESLint configuration
  - `snippets/configs/vitest/` - Vitest configuration + guide
  - `snippets/configs/vscode/` - VS Code settings
- Better organization and discoverability

#### Documentation Structure

- Implemented **3-level context loading hierarchy**:
  - Level 1 (Always): ~600 tokens (core/ + CLAUDE.md)
  - Level 2 (Contextual): ~150-300 tokens (specific rules/)
  - Level 3 (On-Demand): ~50-150 tokens (templates/ + snippets/)
- Added comprehensive cross-referencing between files
- Improved navigation with INDEX files

### Removed

- **Deleted** `commands/generate-commit-message.md` (merged into commit-push-smart.md)
- **Removed** redundant content from CLAUDE.md (delegated to specialized files)

